ofdrw-rs
Copyright 2026 ofdrw-rs contributors

Rust implementation inspired by the OFDRW project:
https://github.com/ofdrw/ofdrw
The upstream Java project is licensed under Apache-2.0.

Java interoperability tests and test fixtures are derived from or reference
that project. Test certificates and private keys are public test material,
not production credentials. Fixture origins and additional font/profile
license notices are recorded in crates/ofdrw/tests/fixtures/README.md.

Bundled SVG-to-PDF converter:
crates/ofdrw-svg2pdf is derived from typst/svg2pdf 0.13.0, upstream commit
ccab6d7a3081f512d412dfef456caed2caf3a698.
https://github.com/typst/svg2pdf
Authors: Laurenz Stampfl and Martin Haug, and upstream contributors.
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0; both license texts are retained in that directory.
Changes add missing-glyph ActualText, explicit lifetimes, formatting and
OFD-specific package metadata/default features. See its README for details.

